<title>USA: Ion Laser says patent to be allowed.</title>
<headline>Ion Laser says patent to be allowed.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ion Laser Technology Inc said it received notification from the United States Patent Office that its patent pending claims for a dental device for composite curing will be allowed.</p>
<p>Although the collimated beam is useful in the company's laser tooth whitening process, the company said the patent claim does not refer to laser tooth whitening.</p>
<p>The company expects to receive communication regarding its laser whitening claims within the next few months.</p>
</text>
